# Keep LF line ends in files that are read byte for byte or run by a POSIX shell, also in a Git for Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true): shell scripts, and the release key list that `task lint:keys` compares with the
# block embedded in deploy/install.sh (docs/m1/06-deploy-and-ci.md §4.3, §9.4).
*.sh text eol=lf
deploy/keys/allowed_signers text eol=lf
